  "prefLabel": "Sep 302.03 Approval of Pre-Licensing Fieldwork Programs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sep 302.03 Approval of Pre-Licensing Fieldwork Programs. A pre-licensing fieldwork program shall meet the following requirements:\n\n(a) Formal pre-licensing fieldwork programs shall:\n\n(1) Require candidates to complete at least 5 evaluations during the program, in addition to 10 evaluations supervised by a New Hampshire licensed evaluator;\n\n(2) Require candidates to evaluate at least 3 different types of septic systems; and\n\n(3) Evaluate students on a pass or fail basis; or\n\n(b) Informal pre-licensing fieldwork programs shall require candidates for licensure to complete at least 25 septic evaluations of 5 different septic system types, under the supervision of a New Hampshire licensed septic system evaluator, provided that the applicant provides copies of the inspection reports that are signed by the supervisor with their application for licensure.\n\nSource. #12392, INTERIM, eff 9-28-17, EXPIRED: 3-27-18\n\nNew. #12654, eff 10-31-18; ss by #14360, eff 10-26-25, EXPIRES: 10-26-35 (formerly Sep 302.04)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sep100-700.html"
